    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92857" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥύσις</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ,
			</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>flow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					944b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὸ κοιλότατον ἡ ῥ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				355b17
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμπωτις</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				366a19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ ῥινῶν αἵματος -ιες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					3.27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοιλίης</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.14
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαίου</span>], i.e.
			<i>yield</i> of oil, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				4.14.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				60.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλεβῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					668a11
				</span></i>
			; of fire, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				54
			</span></i>; <i>shedding</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.120
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.431
			</span></i>; used for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γονόρροια</span>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				15.2
			</span></i> sq. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>course of a river, stream</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποταμὸς
				ποιεῖται τὴν ῥ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.16.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				6.2.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Math.,
				[<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στιγμῆς] ῥύσιν φασὶν εἶναι οἱ
				γεωμέτραι τὴν γραμμήν</span> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥυΐσκομαι, ῥέω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.5b
				</span></i>
			) <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.57
			</span></i> P., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				3.7.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>in Euc.</u>
				p.97
			</span></i> F.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἷον ἄστρου ῥ</span>.
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				395b8
			</span></i>.</div>
